> Janis Papanagnou wrote:
>
>> Would it have been better to uncurse them before polypiling?

The dangerous armor types tend to be created cursed.  Since polypiling
does not change BUC fixed or enhantment status it's a good idea if you
have the resources.  On the other hand it's important to have the
resources to uncurse a piece of armor if you try it on to identify it -
You are unlikely to be in a situation where you are that desparate.

